r":"2017"},{"page":6,"title":"Girl running in a street","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl talking to her grandmother","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl pointing at ants at the optician","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":9,"title":"Ants crawling","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":10,"title":"Girl wearing glasses, ants on alphabet chart","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":11,"title":"Octopus, frog, fish, spaceship floating in water and space","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":12,"title":"Girl jumping in excitement, grandmother smiling","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":13,"title":"Girl poinitng at a green blob","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":14,"title":"Circle triangle and square","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":15,"title":"Circles flower","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":16,"title":"Triangle star","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"},{"page":17,"title":"Rectangle window","illustrator":"Shrujana Shridhar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2017"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":686},"text":["ಚಿಯುಗೆ ಶಾಲೆಗೆ ಹೋಗಲು ತಡವಾಗಿದೆ.","ನೀರಿನ ಕೆಂಪು ಬಾಟಲಿ ಸಿಗುತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":373},"text":["ಅದೇನು ಅವಳ ಬಾಟಲಿನಾ ಅಥವಾ ರಾಕೆಟ್ಟಾ?"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":373},"text":["ಚಿಯು ಬೋರ್ಡ್ ನೋಡಿ ಬೆರಗಾದಳು,","“ಅ ರೆ! ಆ ಮೀನುಗಳೇನು ಸಮುದ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ಈಜುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾವಾ?”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":380},"text":["ಶೂ ಮೇಲಿನ ಹಸಿರು ಮುದ್ದೆ ನೋಡಿ ಚಿಯು ಅಂದುಕೊಂಡಳು,","“ಅದು ಅಂಟಂಟಾಗಿ, ಲೋಳೆಯಂತಿತ್ತು. ಕಪ್ಪೆ ಇರಬಹುದಾ? ”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p05.jpg","width":639,"height":336},"text":["ಮನೆಗೆ ಓಡಿ ಹೋದ ಚಿಯು ಅಜ್ಜಿಗೆ ಹೇಳಿದಳು.","“ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಯಾರಿಗೂ ಕಾಣದಿರುವುದು ನನಗಷ್ಟೇ ಕಾಣುತ್ತಲ್ಲ,","ಏನೋ ಜಾದೂ ಇರಬೇಕು!”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":380},"text":["ಹ್ಞೂಂಗುಟ್ಟಿದ ಅಜ್ಜಿ, \"ನಾವು ಕಣ್ಣಿನ ಡಾಕ್ಟರ ಬಳಿ ಹೋಗೋಣವಾ,","ಅದು ಹೇಗೆ ಜಾದೂ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಿದೆ ಕೇಳೋಣವಾ? ”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":510},"text":["ಡಾಕ್ಟರ್ ನಿಕಿತಾ, ಚಿಯು ಗೆ ಒಂದು ಚಾರ್ಟ್ ತೋರಿಸಿದರು.","“ಆ ಇರುವೆಗಳು ಪೇಪರ್ ಮೇಲೆ ಮೆರವಣಿಗೆ ಹೋಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದಾವಾ?” ಎಂದು ಕೇಳಿದಳು ಚಿಯೂ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":373},"text":["ಡಾಕ್ಟರ್, ಚಿಯು ಗೆ ಕನ್ನಡಕ ಹಾಕಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಿದರು.","ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಇರುವೆಯು ಇ ಅಕ್ಷರವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡಿತು."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":373},"text":["“ ಡಾಕ್ಟರ್, ಜಾದೂ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಿದ್ದ ನನ್ನ ಕಣ್ಣೆಲ್ಲಿ?” ಚಿಯು ಕೇಳಿದಳು.","“ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳನ್ನು ಮುಚ್ಚಿ ನೋಡು ಅದು ಮತ್ತೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತೆ,” ಅಂದರು ಡಾಕ್ಟರ್ ನಿಕಿತಾ."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p11.jpg","width":639,"height":336},"text":["“ ಚಿಯು, ನಿನಗೆ ಯಾವ ಬಣ್ಣದ ಕನ್ನಡಕ ಇಷ್ಟ?” ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಕೇಳುತ್ತಾಳೆ.","“ನ ನಗೆ… ಆಂ… ಹಸಿರು ಬಣ್ಣದ್ದು…” ಚಿ ಯು ಜಿಗಿದಳು."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಕನ್ನಡಕದ ಪ್ರಸಂಗ","ಚಿಯು ಕನ್ನಡಕ ಹಾಕಿಕೊಂಡಿಲ್ಲವಾದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಸರಿಯಾಗಿ ಕಾಣಿಸುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.","ನೀವೂ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಸಹಾಯ ಮಾಡಬಹುದಾ?"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಆಕೃತಿಗಳನ್ನು ಹೆಸರಿಸಿ."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಈ ಹೂವಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ವೃತ್ತಾಕಾರಗಳು ಅಡಗಿವೆ?"]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p15.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಈ ನಕ್ಷತ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು","ತ್ರಿಕೋನಗಳು ಕಾಣಿಸುತ್ತಿವೆ?"]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/26560-chiyoo-kanda-jaadoo/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಕಿಟಕಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಚೌಕಗಳಿವೆ?"]}],"wordCount":154}